\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Marmorpapier (s.o.).\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vacant\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (alte Signaturen, s.o.).\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 271\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Les Grandes Chroniques de France, selon que elles sont conserve\u233 \'e9s en l\rquote \u201 \'c9glise de Saint-Denis en France}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 1. Teil (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Prolog; 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Origines bis Pepin [1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I. Buch: Origines bis Clovis; 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II. Buch: Childebert bis Chilperic; 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  III. Buch: Chilperic bis Clotaire II; 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  IV. Buch: Clotaire II; 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  V. Buch: Clotaire II bis Pepin];\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Charlemaines [90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I. Buch; 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II. Buch; 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  III. Buch; 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  IV. Buch]; 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Loys le D\u233 \'e9bonnaire; 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Charles-le-Chauf; 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Loys-le-Baube; 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Loys et Charlemaine; 179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Charles-le-Simple; 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Raoul; 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Loys-D\rquote Outremer; 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Lothaire; roy Loys, fils de Lothaire; Charles, fr\u232 \'e8re au roy Lothaire; 189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Hues Cappet; 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Robert; 194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf6  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Henri; 198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Philippe I; 208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Loy-le-Gros; 230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Loys-le-Jeune; 243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 271\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Philippe-Auguste [243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I. Buch; 256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 271\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II. Buch; 271\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  III. Buch]). Unvollendet (2. Teil dieser Chronik ist der Cod.gall. 5 [beginnend mit Philipp dem Sch\u246 \'f6nen]). }

