\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gilles Binchois}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Chansons}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [= VII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Margarite fleur [Exzerpte]; 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [= VII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash VIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vostre tres doulx regart; 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\sub\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [= VIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash IX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Helas que poray je; 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [= IX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash X\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Mon cuer chante; 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [= X\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Adieu jusques je vous;\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [= XIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Depuis le congie [Exzerpte]; 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [= XIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash XIV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vostre alee me desplaist; 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\sub\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [= XIV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Je ne fay tousjour [Exzerpte]; 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [= XIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 9\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Chansons\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Exzerpte); 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [= XIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash XX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ma dame que j\u8125 ?ayme; 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [= XX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; nicht gez\u228 \'e4hlte Nr. 11] Deul angoisseux rage; siehe\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Hugo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Riemann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 1892). 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vacant.}

