\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Handschriftenarchiv 1982. \endash  Claudine \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lemaire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in: La Librairie des Ducs de Bourgogne. Manuscrits conserv\u233 \'e9s \u224 \'e0 la Biblioth\u232 \'e8que Royale de Belgique (Textes didactiques 2), hrsg. von Bernard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bousmanne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Fr\u233 \'e9d\u233 \'e9rique \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Johan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und C\u233 \'e9line van \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hoorebeeck\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Turnhout 2003, S. 200. \endash  Livia \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Visser-Fuchs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , The manuscript of the \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 enseignement de vraie noblesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  made for Richard Neville, Earl of Warwick, in 1464. In: Medieval manuscripts in transition. Tradition and creative recycling (Mediaevalia Lovaniensia 36), hrsg. von Gert H.M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Claassens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und Werner \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Verbeke\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Leuven 2006, S. 355 (Nr. 6). \endash  Hanno \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Wijsman\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Luxury Bound. Illustrated Manuscript Production and Noble and Princely Book Ownership in the Burgundian Netherlands (1400-1550). Turnhout 2010, S. 413, 416. }

