plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Feria IV hebdomadae sanctae; 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De s. Andrea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  De conversione s. Pauli; 178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  De purificatione BMV; 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  De d. Benedicto; 192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  In annuntiatione; 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  mit Datierung {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [\u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hier eynden Bernaerdus sermoenen van onser vrouwen boetscap int iaer ons heren M IIIIC ende LXXI}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  \u8230 \'85]}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). 211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vacant. Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneider\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

